      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have the same problem. Server side rank of my avatar is Very Poor, but Medium in game and SDK. After some tests and reuploads I suspect that Texture Memory is being calculated incorrectly on the server side.\n\nTexture memory of my avatar is 47 MB. Server ranks my avatar as Very Poor. When I changed all textures to something like 128x128, then server recalculated its rank correctly as Medium.\n\nHere is my public avatar for investigating the issue:\n\navtr_71468f19-b557-4a02-94d3-219d1bf6839e\n\nI also attach a screenshot of my textures configuration, maybe you can spot some unusual settings that might not work properly with server side calculation.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
