      "value": "I am having the same issue with my avatar for Android. Avatar ID is:\n\navtr_86d72358-9184-4ad8-a45d-194a84526949\n\nUnity VRChat SDK and running VRChat show Good, but VRChat website shows Medium.\n\nMy avatar's performance rank on server went from Medium to Good after I removed some constraints. After several uploads with different conditions, I guess I need to reduce the number of constraints to 16 or less.\n\nFYI, VRChat documentation says Good should have 60 or less constraints, and Excellent should have 30 or less.\n\nhttps://creators.vrchat.com/avatars/avatar-performance-ranking-system#mobile-limits",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
